# Point of Sale — Sale Line
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Retail — one Product/Quantity fact inside a Sale
# Case 16 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: pos-sale.menata
#
# Split out from pos-sale.menata (corrected 2026-07-11): originally an inline
# `Table of (...)` field. Already fully expressible as an ordinary Object References
# pattern (001-object.md §Relationships) — "a Sale has many Lines" is implied by
# "each Line references one Sale," no separate grammar needed. Same shape as
# ecommerce-order-line.menata / accounting-journal-entry-line.menata.

Sale Line

Fields

- Sale : Sale
- Product : Product
- Quantity : Number
- Unit Price : Money
- Line Total : Money

Constraints

- Product is required.
- Quantity must be greater than zero.
- Line Total must equal Quantity times Unit Price.

Permissions

Cashier

- View

Views

- Sale Line List : List
